Z||000000||Slick781||12-30-2000||12:09 AM||||alright... well one time i was watchin this custom car show on tv (as i do alllll the time) and i saw a trcuk where the guy completely removed the door handle and opens the door electronically...  well my question is, how is this done?  if i ever get my own fiero   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  i might just have to do it and fiberglass in the door handle.<P>David<P><BR>sorry, just noticed that i posted this in general, prolly should be in technical<p>[This message has been edited by Slick781 (edited 12-30-2000).]||||reg||1
Z||000001||rogergarrison||12-30-2000||11:03 AM||||its pretty ez. all you need is a add on key fob door lock kit, where you press the button on keychain and doors unlock. just connect the solenoid to the door latch instead of the lock. then fill in the handle hole. can u see door handles on mine?<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1234884&a=9116379&p=34556781"> ||||reg||1
